## 1. Producers (already run on 2026-09-18; repeat only into a fresh directory)

```bash
python tools/param_curve.py --profile CURVE_K8  --runs ckpt/exp05/eval/*_k8_seed*_k0 \
    --json $R/CURVE_K8.json  --summary $R/CURVE_K8.txt
